A '''kodai (-)''' is a combat potion that boosts the player's [[Magic]] level by 4 + 10% of their base level.

It can only be made in the [[Chambers of Xeric]] with 47 [[Herblore]] by using a [[golpar]] with a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while having [[endarkened juice]] in the inventory.

This potion is the weakest variant of the kodai potions, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. As a consequence, it does not help in casting [[enchantment spells]].

==Effects==
Magic boost is calculated with: <math>\lfloor MagicLevel \times \frac{10}{100} \rfloor + 4</math>
